  "text": "Lionel Messi was Argentina’s most valuable player, topping the overall impact ranking ahead of Ángel Di María.\n\nHis contribution combined decisive scoring with sustained involvement: he scored the opening penalty and struck again in extra time, while completing 88% of his 51 passes. That blend of finishing and keeping attacks moving gives him the edge over Di María, who was also hugely influential. [[ev:sb:3869685:771]] [[ev:sb:3869685:4070]] [[ev:sb:3869685:3927]]",
